## Method Brace Placement Examples

### ❌ Incorrect - Braces on same line

```vala
// BAD - Inconsistent with control statements
public string getName() {
    return this.name;
}

public void setName(string name) {
    this.name = name;
}
```

```javascript
// BAD - Inconsistent with control statements
function getName() {
    return this.name;
}

const setName = (name) => {
    this.name = name;
}
```

```java
// BAD - Inconsistent with control statements
public String getName() {
    return this.name;
}

public void setName(String name) {
    this.name = name;
}
```

```c
// BAD - Inconsistent with control statements
int getValue() {
    return this.value;
}

void setValue(int value) {
    this.value = value;
}
```

### ✅ Correct - Braces on new line

```vala
// GOOD - Consistent with control statements
